# Keep LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says. The client half is
# served to the browser byte-for-byte by DSH, so a CRLF checkout would change what the page runs and
# turn every diff into noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
